  "equipment_type": "Boiler (commercial water heater)",
  "applies_to": "Lochinvar Armor water heaters, models 1250-4000, Series 100 and 101, with the SMART SYSTEM control and Modbus/BACnet communication board, per 100305786_2000558371 Rev C.",
  "summary": "The large Armor water heaters (1250-4000 MBH) use the SMART SYSTEM control and a Modbus RTU communication board on RS-485. The BAS can write a configuration word, an enable word, a rate or setpoint command and a remote tank temperature; it reads switch and flame states, outlet/inlet/flue temperatures, firing rate, cascade power and the status, blocking and lockout codes of the unit and its cascade members.",
